MODULE: SourceMatchesDecisionOrdinaryLosesHlc
TARGET: SourceMatchesDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an ordinary append uses WAL arrival order instead of independent source HLC
PERTURBS: AppendOrdinary

--- FIND
    /\ source' = IF Stamp(1) > Stamp(source[1])
                  THEN Replace(source, 1) ELSE source
--- REPLACE
    /\ source' = Replace(source, 1)
--- END
